+:: vcpkg builds pass extra include dirs (e.g. ttmath) via FIREBIRD_VCPKG_INCLUDE.
+:: vcvarsall above resets INCLUDE, so append after it. Guarded to run once per
+:: process as this file is called several times during a build.
+@if defined FIREBIRD_VCPKG_INCLUDE (
+  @if not defined FB_VCPKG_INCLUDE_SET (
+    @set "INCLUDE=%INCLUDE%;%FIREBIRD_VCPKG_INCLUDE%"
+    @set FB_VCPKG_INCLUDE_SET=1
+  )
+)
